  "historyNote": "#6103, eff 10-26-95; ss by #6911, eff 12-15-98; ss by #8190, eff 10-19-04; ss by #10045, eff 1-1-12; ss by #10045, eff 1-1-12, EXPIRED: 1-1-20 New. #13942, eff 6-25-24",
